>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: <a href=\"#/wiki/Creatures\">Creatures</a></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-item-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20150422164224&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Tiquandas_Revenge_29f7f2.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"creature-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see  Tiquandas Revenge.</div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"><span class=\"tibiatext tibiaorange\"><ul class=\"sound-list\"></ul></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>It's the <a href=\"#/wiki/Carniphila\">Carniphila</a>'s boss. It looks and behaves like a <a href=\"#/wiki/Carniphila\">Carniphila</a>, but it is much stronger.\n</p>\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\" data-seq-no=\"0\" hash=\"4547c292d63e63c828c9e9cee9eafe7c\" id=\"w-gallery-0\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:154px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Tiquandas_revenge_gallery-jpg\" style=\"position: relative; height:152px; width:185px;\"><img alt=\"Paladin killing the Carniphila's boss with Sudden Death runes, while Knight blocks.\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-caption=\" killing the 's boss with  runes, while  blocks.\" height=\"152\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Tiquandas_revenge_gallery_ed3e7a.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"Tiquandas revenge gallery.jpg (116 KB)\" width=\"185\"/></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Paladin\">Paladin</a> killing the <a href=\"#/wiki/Carniphila\">Carniphila</a>'s boss with <a href=\"#/wiki/Sudden%20Death\">Sudden Death</a> runes, while <a href=\"#/wiki/Knight\">Knight</a> blocks.</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:154px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Tiquandas_Revenge_Special_Task-jpg\" style=\"position: relative; height:135px; width:185px; top:8.5px;\"><img alt=\"Knight killing Tiquandas Revenge; as a reward from special task on Antica.\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-caption=\" killing Tiquandas Revenge; as a reward from special task on .\" height=\"152\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Tiquandas_Revenge_Special_Task_1c26f1.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"Tiquandas Revenge Special Task.jpg (83 KB)\" width=\"185\"/></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Knight\">Knight</a> killing Tiquandas Revenge; as a reward from special task on Antica.</div></div></div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-abilities\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Abilities\">Abilities</span></h3>\n<div class=\"ability_list\"><div class=\"creatureAbility\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\"><span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span> Melee</span> (0-220)</div>⁠, <div class=\"creatureAbility\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\"><span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Poisoned\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Poisoned_Icon_7605e0.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span> Poisons you</span> (9 hp/turn)</div>⁠, <div class=\"creatureAbility\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\"><span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Slowed\"><img alt=\"Paralyze\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Slowed_Icon_942885.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span> Paralyzes</span></div>⁠, <div class=\"creatureAbility\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\"><span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Healing\"><img alt=\"Healing\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Healing_Icon_be4df6.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span> Self-Healing</span> (?)</div>⁠, <div class=\"creatureAbility\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\"><span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Hasted\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Haste_Icon_105a69.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span> Strong Haste</span></div>⁠, <div class=\"creatureAbility\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\"><span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Earth Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Poisoned_Icon_7605e0.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span> Earth Berserk</span> (0-250)</div>⁠, <div class=\"creatureAbility\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\"><span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Earth Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Poisoned_Icon_7605e0.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span> Stalagmite</span> (440)</div></div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mobile-hide\" id=\"w-creature-resistance-table\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Damage_Taken_From_Elements\">Damage Taken From Elements</span></h3>\n<div id=\"w-creature-resistance-d\">\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"0.9900\" title=\"Physical\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Physical <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Bestiary Physical Icon Big\" class=\"mw-fil